Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗森受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronson's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要医护救治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs medical evac.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬盘在哪？还在那吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Is it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬盘不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard drive's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.05,0:01:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定 给我点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone. Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是他们拿了 去追{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have it. Get after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在处理罗森的伤势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stabilizing Ronson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮他止血！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to stop the bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到他了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那辆黑色奥迪里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the black Audi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗森怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Ronson?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会派紧急疏散小组过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sending an emergency evacuation squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太慢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be too bloody late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's seen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护队五分钟内会去救罗森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical evac for Ronson five minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你用不到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. You weren't using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个我也用不上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't using that one, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快闪开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦纳 怎么走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanner, which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续直走 我会告诉你怎么走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. I can direct you from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.97,0:04:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道此次任务的重要性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both know what's at stake here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果名单丢了 后果不堪设想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't afford to lose that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据显示 他们应该在集市一带的房顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They appear to be on the rooftops of the Grand Bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从左边走 那有一座桥 你可以拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a left. There's a bridge. You can cut him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快趴下 先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.53,0:06:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况？- 他们上火车了 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - They're on the train, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,上火车是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他们在火车顶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're on top of a train.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快跟上 别磨蹭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get after them, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快跑出监控范围了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟踪不到了 我们监视不到那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost tracking. We're blind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在什么情况？- 我还在跟着他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I'm still with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接通闭路电视 人造卫星 任何东西！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me CCTV, satellite, anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么声音？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,几辆大众甲壳虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}VW Beetles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德！他弄断了车厢连接链{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond! He's uncoupling the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.73,0:09:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚换了车厢而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just changing carriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？快汇报！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很复杂 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rather hard to explain, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,007还在继续追捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007's still in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面没有路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there isn't much more road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法继续往下追了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但两个人纠缠在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 我没法开枪 他们没分开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, I do not have a clean shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有个山洞 目标快消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a tunnel ahead. I'm gonna lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找到更好的位置吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get into a better position?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到 没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到！我会打到邦德的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't! I may hit Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the bloody shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:26.22,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之大破天幕杀机》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:55.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦 军情六处）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:13.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（讣告：詹姆斯·邦德指挥官 皇家海军三等爵士）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像是被召唤去校长办公室一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like being summoned to the headmaster's study.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是新上任的主席 只是例行公事罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a new Chairman. Just standard procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说这是在浪费我的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody waste of my time is what I call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾我们第一次见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to have to deal with such.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要处理这么敏感的话题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a delicate subject at our first encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须向你坦白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to be frank with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想坦白是最好的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that would be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相很担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister's concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你可以告诉他我的特工们正在地毯式搜索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you can tell him my operatives are pursuing every avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你考虑过撤回特工吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you considered pulling out the agents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,能考虑的办法我都考虑过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've considered every option.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无冒犯之意 但这听起来像是逃避问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, that sounds like an evasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无冒犯之意 但为什么要叫我过来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个月之前 你弄丢了一个硬盘 里面几乎包含了所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three months ago, you lost the computer drive containing the identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.89,0:18:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,北约组织国家安插在全球恐怖组织中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of almost every NATO agent embedded in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,做卧底的特工身份名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrorist organizations across the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 在我们同盟国的眼中 这个硬盘根本不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A list which, in the eyes of our allies, never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以请你原谅 我认为你很清楚为什么叫你过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you'll forgive me, I think you know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要称之为「监管平民」吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we to call this "civilian oversight"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们要称之为「退休计划」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're to call this "retirement planning."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家对你和你这么多年的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your country has only the highest respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,表示极大的感激和敬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your many years of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你现任期满以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your current posting is completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被授予十字勋章的最高荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be awarded GCMG with full honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.55,0:19:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要炒了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're firing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.26,0:19:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 夫人 我来这是为了在你两个后资源退休前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma'am, I'm here to oversee the transition period.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,监管整个过渡期的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leading to your voluntary retirement in two months' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.89,0:19:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的接班人还没有定 所以我们想问一下你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your successor has yet to be appointed, so we'll be asking you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是白痴 马洛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an idiot, Mallory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我不可能永远在这个位置上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can't do this job forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但让我留下一堆麻烦然后走人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll be damned if I'm going to leave the department.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是坚决不肯的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in worse shape than I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 你已经做的很好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, you've had a great run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该光荣隐退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should leave with dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 去他的光荣 等一切弄妥了我自会走人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, to hell with dignity. I'll leave when the job's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 来自Q组的警报 有人试图解译被偷的硬盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, alert from Q-Branch. Someone's trying to decrypt the stolen hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在追踪加密讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're tracing the encryption signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在定位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Localizing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是国内发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Centering in the UK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}London.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快赶回总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us back to base as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从军情六处发出的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from Ml6.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据包正在连接我们的网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The data packet is linking to our network.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 它在我们的防火墙里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction. This is behind our firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该关掉系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别关 跟踪它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, track it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.64,0:20:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找出具体位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to know where it's coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掉标头 追踪来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strip the headers. Trace the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么侵入我们系统的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did they get into our system?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在显示追踪结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting trace back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面显示…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面显示是从您的电脑上发出的 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears to be your computer, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:01.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（想想你的罪行）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么名堂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧把路让出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们认不出这辆车吗？- 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you recognize the car? - Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是CNN突发新闻报导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is CNN Breaking News.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:24:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急调查人员仍在估算损伤程度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency crews are still attempting to assess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方也在全力追查这起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the damage as investigators hunt for leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.69,0:24:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在伦敦市中心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in what now appears to be a major.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.86,0:24:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,重大恐怖袭击的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrorist attack in the heart of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.57,0:24:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还没有人声明要对此次发生在伦敦特情局的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one has yet claimed responsibility for what sources are calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.95,0:24:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「网络恐怖袭击」 事件负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a possible "cyber-terrorist assault" on the British Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,此次事件初步调查显示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early reports from the scene indicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有六人死亡 多人受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least six dead, many more injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸发生后几分钟后 伤者就被{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with victims being evacuated to local hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.13,0:24:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,送往了当地医院救治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}within minutes of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.11,0:24:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找出凶手的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to find whoever did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.62,0:25:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在享受死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,007回来复命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 reporting for duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.47,0:25:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不先打个电话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.47,0:26:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没收到明信片吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't get the postcard?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也应该找时间试试 丢开一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try it some time. Get away from it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.85,0:26:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的能让你变得洞察一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really lends perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.31,0:26:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方的酒都被你喝光了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran out of drink where you were, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么来着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.40,0:26:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「快开枪」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Take the bloody shot."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.65,0:26:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是根据形势做出了判断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a judgment call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该相信我能完成任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have trusted me to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能会让你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the possibility of losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.82,0:26:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者其他特工命丧黄泉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the certainty of losing all those other agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.57,0:26:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我只能做一个选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the only decision I could and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.37,0:26:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是你没勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you lost your nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.83,0:26:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还指望什么 我给你道个歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you expect, a bloody apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.67,0:26:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这游戏的规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经玩了很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been playing it long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both have.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话对你自己说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗森没救活是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronson didn't make it, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.35,0:26:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全玩儿完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're both played out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.19,0:26:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果你这样认为 干嘛还回来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you believe that, why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.95,0:26:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们被袭击了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.70,0:27:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.04,0:27:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须经过审查 然后判定是否合适参与任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to be debriefed and declared fit for active service.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.21,0:27:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你通过测试 否则别想回来继续干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can only return to duty when you've passed the tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.72,0:27:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以认真一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so take them seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.47,0:27:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许应该先洗个澡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a shower might be in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.39,0:27:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回家换个衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go home and change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.47,0:27:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我们把你的公寓卖了 你的东西都放储藏室了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we've sold your flat, put your things into storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.10,0:27:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是单身特工死后的标准处理程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard procedure on the death of an unmarried employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.31,0:27:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没任何亲戚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with no next of kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的应该先打电话的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have called.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.57,0:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我找个酒店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便 总之你肯定不能住在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're bloody well not sleeping here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.81,0:28:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击者黑进了环境控制系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The assailant hacked into the environmental control system,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁了安全协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked out the safety protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.27,0:28:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后打开了燃气 能完成这些事按理说应该是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turned on the gas, all of which should have been impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.94,0:28:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们黑进了她的档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On top of that, they hacked into her files.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.65,0:28:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看了她的行程 知道她那时不在总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew her appointments, knew she'd be out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.66,0:28:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的目标不是她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't targeting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想让她目睹着一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted her to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪 坦纳？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we, Tanner?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.87,0:28:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,新家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New digs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来的办公室对外宣称是「战略要害」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old building was declared "strategically vulnerable".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.55,0:28:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是一种委婉的表达方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's putting it mildly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能够轻易侵入英国最安全的电脑系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was able to breach the most secure computer system in Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.06,0:28:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们现在处于战备状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're on war footing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.68,0:28:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里曾是丘吉尔时代地堡的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was part of Churchill's bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在探索这些历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still discovering tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.69,0:28:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以追溯到18世纪的隧道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dating back to the 18th Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.15,0:28:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有老鼠 这环境还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite fascinating, if it wasn't for the rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.69,0:29:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候见M？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do I see M?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.24,0:29:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你运气好的话明天就能见到M和马洛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow you'll see M and Mallory, too, if you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.82,0:29:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,马洛利是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Mallory?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报安全委员会的新任主席{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new Chairman of the Intelligence and Security Committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.91,0:29:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个魅力十足的男人 我觉得你和他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming man. I think you and he.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定能合得来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are really going to hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到新军情六处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the new MI6.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尝试追踪那条电脑信息的来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've attempted to trace the computer message, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是发现数据经过了不对称加密计算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was sent by an asymmetrical security algorithm,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过一千多台不同的服务器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which bounced the signal all over the globe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,向全球反射信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}through over a thousand different servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.86,0:29:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在他们已经获取了M的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that they've accessed M's codes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.69,0:29:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,破解这份名单只是时间问题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's only a matter of time before they're able to decrypt the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q组分析了图片 但到目前为止没有任何收获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q-Branch have been analyzing the picture but so far nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一感觉很有可能是她过去的一位老友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The general feeling is it's probably someone from her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.45,0:29:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是她在香港执行任务那段时期认识的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps when she was running things in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:29:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对此毫无头绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's no idea what it all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.67,0:29:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些你都信吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:30:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 我们还没有窃取名单的人的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, we don't have a clue who took the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.25,0:30:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是他们打算拿来做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what they plan to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.22,0:30:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全可以随后再讨论这些问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can always do this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.39,0:30:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就之后再说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.38,0:31:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们先做一些简单的词汇关联测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to start with some simple word associations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需告诉我出现在你脑海里的第一个词语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me the first word that pops into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如 我会说「一天」 你就说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, I might say "Day" and you might say…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.63,0:31:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.89,0:31:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.60,0:31:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪械{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.06,0:31:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 射击 - 特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shot. - Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,奸细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provocateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.65,0:31:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.74,0:31:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,女奸细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provocatrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.99,0:31:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.32,0:31:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.70,0:31:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,M夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.33,0:32:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.54,0:32:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 月光 - 舞蹈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moonlight. - Dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.67,0:32:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Employment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.67,0:32:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 国家 - 英国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Country. - England.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠天庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skyfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.51,0:32:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠天庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skyfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.35,0:32:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 进行得还算顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析下这些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get these analyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.41,0:33:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果只给她一个人看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her eyes only.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.44,0:33:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她准备好见你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.49,0:33:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我们之前见过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, have we met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.49,0:33:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是那个该说「抱歉」的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who should say "sorry".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.87,0:34:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只弄断了我4根肋骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only four ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些不太重要的器官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the less vital organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.96,0:34:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没伤到重要部位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing major.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.80,0:34:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伊斯坦布尔的时候够刺激吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough excitement in Istanbul?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经重新分配工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.22,0:34:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时停止了现场任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporary suspension from field work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.47,0:34:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.97,0:34:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我射杀了007{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to do with killing 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.01,0:34:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你那一枪打得很准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you gave it your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.89,0:34:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那根本不是我的最好水平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was hardly my best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.06,0:34:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是用了最好水平 不知道我还能不能活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I could survive your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.23,0:34:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会有机会再试试了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt you'll get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.40,0:34:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 帮我个忙 可以吗？如果他们还让你出去执行任务的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do me a favor, will you? If they do ever let you back out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.99,0:34:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先通知下我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}warn me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.82,0:34:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在过渡期协助加雷斯·马洛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assisting Gareth Mallory in the transition,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就会继续执行现场任务了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll be back in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.91,0:34:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你想要的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.49,0:34:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.16,0:34:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作不是所有人都能做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.83,0:34:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 这边请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, 007. It's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你说句话 移动的目标射击难度更大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your defense, a moving target is much harder to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.51,0:34:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好别停下脚步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you better keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,整间办公室都烧光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole office goes up in smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.81,0:35:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个该死的磁盘却没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that bloody thing survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.07,0:35:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢你对原大楼内部装修的见解 007{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your interior decorating tips have always been appreciated, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 这位是加雷斯·马洛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, Gareth Mallory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.03,0:35:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我没错过什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I haven't missed anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相在这场危机中还真是气定神闲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The PM does prattle on in a crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 邦德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马洛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mallory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚审阅了邦德的测试报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just been reviewing Bond's tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.71,0:35:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你通过了… 不过勉勉强强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you've passed… by the skin of your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.42,0:35:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在复役了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back on active service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.22,0:35:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.93,0:35:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.51,0:35:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是出去等着吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.81,0:35:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想问你一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only have one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.39,0:35:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么又回来了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not stay dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你隐退的绝佳机会 去一个宁静的地方安享晚年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the perfect way out. Go and live quietly somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.73,0:35:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的特工能这么彻底地离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many field agents get to leave this cleanly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参与过很多现场任务吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get out in the field much?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做现场特工 并不意味着我不懂形势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be an operative to see the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.08,0:36:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是年轻人的行当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a young man's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.91,0:36:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你受过重伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you've been seriously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.67,0:36:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手变笨拙了也不必觉得遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no shame in saying you've lost a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.33,0:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的遗憾就是承认得太晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only shame would be not admitting it until it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.26,0:36:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,需不需要我 全凭你说了算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hire me or fire me. It's entirely up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他认为准备好了 那就没有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he says he's ready, he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.14,0:36:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你看不出来 或许你根本不想看出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can't see it, or maybe you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.01,0:36:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在暗示什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you implying?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.27,0:36:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他太仁慈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sentimental about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.31,0:36:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我还是这个部门的负责人 要什么人就是我说了算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I'm head of this department, I'll choose my own operatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.44,0:36:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.99,0:36:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 007{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.95,0:36:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't cock it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.63,0:36:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分析了那些弹片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've analyzed the shrapnel fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很走运 当时不是被直接命中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky it wasn't a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.21,0:37:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则就会把你切成两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or it would have cut you in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一枚贫铀弹 军事级别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a depleted uranium shell. Military grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.97,0:37:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难获取到 价格十分昂贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to get, extremely expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.14,0:37:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且是受限制使用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only used by a select few.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.73,0:37:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有认识的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognize anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.81,0:37:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.02,0:37:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 这人叫帕特里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Name's Patrice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.61,0:37:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个幽灵 没有固定住所或国籍资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a ghost. No known residence or country of origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎样才能找到他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.86,0:37:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 我们在中情局还有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, luckily, we still have one or two friends left in the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们负责也门大使谋杀案 正在追查他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're after him for the Yemeni ambassador's murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.12,0:37:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展还算顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报称 两天后他将会出现在上海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intel is he's going to be in Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.12,0:37:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是去工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in two days time, probably on a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.50,0:37:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在出发 等候新的指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're to go there and await further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.88,0:37:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他出现了 就搞定他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he turns up, he's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.92,0:37:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出他的雇主是谁 以及名单在谁手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out who he works for and who has the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.59,0:37:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后干掉他 为罗森报仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then terminate him, for Ronson.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.68,0:37:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.18,0:37:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么要告诉我的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you want to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.47,0:37:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,向新的军需官报告你所需要的材料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to the new Quartermaster for your documentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.90,0:37:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没正式入职 但坦纳会安排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't set up shop yet, but Tanner will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.02,0:38:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩碰面 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}put you two together. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.19,0:38:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.45,0:38:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.45,0:38:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.12,0:38:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.38,0:38:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道邦德通过了测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know Bond passed the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.96,0:38:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没通过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅画总让我感觉到一丝忧伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always makes me feel a little melancholy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.70,0:38:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘巨大的旧军舰以如此耻辱的方式被拖走报废{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grand old warship being ignominiously hauled away for scrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.63,0:39:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,岁月催人老 你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inevitability of time, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.63,0:39:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.93,0:39:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是艘大军舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bloody big ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.31,0:39:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 等等…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的新军需官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new Quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.73,0:39:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.98,0:39:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 就因为我没穿实验室外套吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, because I'm not wearing a lab coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.90,0:39:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还太嫩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you still have spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.95,0:39:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我的皮肤状况没什么关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My complexion is hardly relevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.03,0:39:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但和你的能力有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your competence is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.83,0:39:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,年龄并不能保证工作效率{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Age is no guarantee of efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻也无法保证一定能革新{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And youth is no guarantee of innovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.16,0:39:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌我穿着睡衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hazard I can do more damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,用喝一杯格雷红茶的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on my laptop sitting in my pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.46,0:39:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在笔记本电脑上造成的伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before my first cup of Earl Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.13,0:39:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你执行任务一年制造的都多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than you can do in a year in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.96,0:39:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那你为什么还需要我呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so why do you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.26,0:39:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候还是需要有人冲锋陷阵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every now and then a trigger has to be pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.18,0:39:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不一定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not pulled.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.47,0:39:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的睡衣里有什么就很难说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to know which in your pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.85,0:40:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 Q{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.77,0:40:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 007{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.94,0:40:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是去上海的机票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ticket to Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.45,0:40:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面还有相关材料和护照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Documentation and passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.07,0:40:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.45,0:40:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特PPK/S9毫米手枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walther PPK/S 9mm short.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在手柄处有一个微型真皮传感器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a micro-dermal sensor in the grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面录入了你的掌纹 所以只有你能使用这把抢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been coded to your palm print so only you can fire it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.76,0:40:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,减少了枪械走火误伤的概率 增加了个人表现的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less of a random killing machine, more of a personal statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.01,0:40:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.64,0:40:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准无线电通信设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard issue radio transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.77,0:40:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,激活它就能发送你所处位置的坐标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate it and it broadcasts your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.23,0:40:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是救援信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.19,0:40:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.94,0:40:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把手枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.11,0:40:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个无线电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.61,0:40:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物有点寒酸 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly Christmas, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.45,0:41:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要一支爆破钢笔吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you expecting an exploding pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.45,0:41:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经不研制那东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't really go in for that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.46,0:41:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你任务好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck out there in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 请把这些设备完好地带回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please return the equipment in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.18,0:41:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢新世界啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.60,0:41:29.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上海）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:24.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（埃瓦航空226号航班 晚上9点到达）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.48,0:49:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,名单在谁手里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's got the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.73,0:49:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我！你为谁卖命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me! Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.32,0:51:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦纳… 他公布了前五个特工的姓名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanner… he's posted the first five names.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.74,0:51:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份已经暴露了 他们现在有危险 让他们快撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their cover's blown. They're in danger. Get them out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.00,0:51:35.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（想想你的罪行）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.70,0:52:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.88,0:52:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有点任何东西 更没有点你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't order anything. Not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.22,0:52:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到了一些新的情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got some new information.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.93,0:52:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你来传递情报是不是有点大材小用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a little overqualified to be delivering messages?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.85,0:52:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是学习曲线的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all part of the learning curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.81,0:52:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且Q很怕坐飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Q's afraid of flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.40,0:52:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.23,0:52:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁窃取了名单 现在内容都已经破解了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whoever stole the list has already decrypted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.61,0:52:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把名单的前五个姓名公布在网上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They posted the first five names on the web.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.32,0:52:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 早就说过这只是时间问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.41,0:52:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这仅仅是个开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.08,0:52:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将每周公布五个新的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're posting five more next week, and the week after.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.87,0:52:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在玩一场虐待狂游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of sadistic game.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.92,0:52:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,割喉剃刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut-throat razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.09,0:53:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这么传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.30,0:53:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢用传统的方式做一些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I like to do some things the old-fashioned way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.93,0:53:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候传统的是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the old ways are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.03,0:53:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又要把命交到我手上了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you putting your life in my hands again?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.07,0:53:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,M已经…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M's…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.16,0:53:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我简单介绍了一下那份名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}already briefed me on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.96,0:53:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿真正的目的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raising the tantalizing question.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.12,0:53:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就很令我好奇了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of what you're really doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.34,0:53:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的官方指令是来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My official directive was to help…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.55,0:53:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「尽我所能」地帮助你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"in any way I can."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.14,0:53:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如为马洛利监视我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like spying for Mallory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.76,0:53:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 马洛利不像你想象的那么坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mallory's not as bad as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.64,0:53:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个官僚主义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bureaucrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.23,0:53:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好做做功课了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.98,0:54:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加雷斯·马洛利曾是一个陆军上校…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gareth Mallory was a Lieutenant Colonel…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,北爱尔兰 赫里福德军团的陆军上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Colonel in Northern Ireland, Hereford Regiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.40,0:54:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在爱尔兰共和军待过三个月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spent three months at the hands of the IRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.53,0:54:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么可以用大智若愚来形容他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's more to him than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.00,0:54:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个待议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.38,0:54:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.21,0:54:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下很难刮哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the tricky part.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.77,0:54:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.94,0:54:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点像以前那样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look the part now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.48,0:54:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hmm? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.65,0:54:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪点像啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what part's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.49,0:54:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人老大不小了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,花招还是那么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}new tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.98,0:56:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.57,0:56:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰你的耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.28,0:56:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现三个出口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got three exits,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.16,0:56:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多监控盲点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lots of blind spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.66,0:56:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我处理好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got them covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.58,0:56:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿这礼服美极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look beautiful in that dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.75,0:56:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打扮得也不错嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't scrub up so bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.50,0:56:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,多双手 你就能神奇地做到很多事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing what one can do with an extra pair of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.97,0:56:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.30,0:56:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赌博吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.14,0:56:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时候小赌一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like a little flutter now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.31,0:56:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢投机取巧呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't like to take chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.32,0:56:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 先生 请问需要点什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sir. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.44,0:56:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮我把这个兑现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to cash this in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.04,0:57:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One moment, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.99,0:57:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您今晚好运 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good fortune tonight, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.70,0:57:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.21,0:57:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,店家附赠的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With compliments of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.01,0:57:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.74,0:58:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在总能给我买杯酒了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can afford to buy me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再多请一杯也没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll even stretch to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.12,0:58:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这箱子里有四百万欧元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing I've got four million euros in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.04,0:58:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 我还蛮喜欢这游戏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. I like this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.21,0:58:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要不我们换个玩玩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we play another?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.13,0:58:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不赌博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.05,0:58:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生来运气就不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.10,0:58:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来跟我们在上海的朋友一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little like our friend in Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.27,0:58:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等来兑现筹码的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting to see who would redeem the chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.98,0:58:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么大摇大摆地闯进我们的布局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made such a bold entrance into our little drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.78,0:58:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我想的太复杂了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I over-complicate the plot?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.24,0:59:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不喜欢偶尔来一段小插曲啊 先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't appreciate the occasional twist, Mr…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.12,0:59:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫詹姆斯·邦德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.49,0:59:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫赛菲林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Severine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.16,0:59:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 那我们要不边喝酒边聊聊你的下步计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Bond, shall we discuss your next performance over that drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.50,0:59:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.96,0:59:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友也要跟过来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will your friends be joining us?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.14,0:59:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这个是难免的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, I'm afraid, is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.35,0:59:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她长得还不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.02,0:59:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你好这口的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you like that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.81,0:59:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好戏我会通知你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep you posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.33,0:59:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.00,0:59:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我问一个生意上的问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind if I asked you a business question?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.04,0:59:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要看什么问题了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.50,0:59:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是跟生死有关的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to do with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事情你也应该很了解才是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A subject in which you're well-versed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.55,1:00:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.56,1:00:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿露背装 大腿上绑着伯莱塔70枪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a certain kind of woman wears a backless dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.52,1:00:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就只有一种女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a Beretta 70 strapped to her thigh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.19,1:00:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是对穿礼服还揣着沃尔特收枪的帅气男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can never be too careful when.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.07,1:00:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心再小心的那种女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}handsome men in tuxedos carry Walthers.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.36,1:00:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你杀了帕特里斯 是没猜错咯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am correct in assuming you killed Patrice?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.37,1:00:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.54,1:00:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问原因吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.58,1:00:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见见你的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to meet your employer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.85,1:00:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,许愿的时候 要小心一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.93,1:00:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.44,1:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的酒啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for the drink,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.11,1:00:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.36,1:01:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你演戏演得不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put on a good show.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过从我们坐下之后 你就不停地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ever since we sat down, you haven't stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的保镖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking at your bodyguards.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.58,1:01:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,配三个保镖 稍微多了点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of them is a bit excessive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.46,1:01:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是在保护你 是在监控你吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're controlling you. They're not protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.05,1:01:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你腕上的纹身是澳门性交易组织的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tattoo on your wrist is Macau sex trade.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.09,1:01:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于其中一家 会是哪家呢？12号？还是13号？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belonged to one of the houses. What were you? 12? 13?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.43,1:01:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 他是你赎身的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing he was your way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你觉得 你是爱上他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you thought you were in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.48,1:01:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那已经是很早之前的事情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.07,1:01:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道别瞎说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know nothing about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.62,1:01:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道女人害怕还要假装镇定是什么样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when a woman is afraid and pretending not to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.29,1:01:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧 你懂多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know about fear?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.00,1:01:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.96,1:02:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.26,1:02:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.26,1:02:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.76,1:02:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.93,1:02:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.68,1:02:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么试？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.10,1:02:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.52,1:02:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能杀了他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.65,1:02:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.32,1:02:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.03,1:02:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总要死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone usually dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.70,1:02:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你真的可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我走了 他们就打算动手杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I leave, they're going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.67,1:02:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你活着出去 我在北港的基梅拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you survive, I'm on the Chimera. North harbor.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.80,1:02:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,七号码头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berth seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.68,1:02:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一小时后起航{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cast off in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.36,1:03:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 邦德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice to have met you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.36,1:03:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.82,1:04:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,自求多福吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.68,1:04:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.98,1:05:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,全压在红色上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it all on red.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.98,1:05:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,生不带来 死不带去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.88,1:05:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.97,1:05:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该起航了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to cast off.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.64,1:05:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.53,1:06:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不带伯莱塔的样子更迷人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you better without your Beretta.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.71,1:06:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有它 我浑身不自在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel naked without it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.93,1:07:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.10,1:07:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于国防部的争论今天进一步扩大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The controversy surrounding the Ministry of Defence has escalated today.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.65,1:07:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,源于侯赛因刺杀事件的图像不断曝光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as images of the Husein assassination continue to circulate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.69,1:07:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,本台提醒大家 这些图片可能会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should warn you, some viewers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.53,1:07:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,引起部分人身体不适{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might find these images disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.78,1:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,侯赛因上校是一名在中东地区卧底的军情六处探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Husein, an MI6 operative embedded in the Middle East,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.28,1:07:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是五名被曝光的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was one of the five agents exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.16,1:07:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员之一 此事件也成为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in what is now being considered.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.08,1:07:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现代英国史上最严重的内部安全漏洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the greatest internal security breach in modern British history.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.08,1:07:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相继续呼吁公众支持军情六处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister continues to express public support for MI6…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.92,1:07:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时反对者已经表明…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the opposition has taken the position…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.34,1:07:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经表明 我们就是一群过时的老白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has taken the position we're a bunch of antiquated bloody idiots.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.88,1:07:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还愚蠢地打着一无所知还希望渺茫的仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fighting a war we don't understand and can't possibly win.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.43,1:07:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我手下已经有三名探员殉职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, three of my agents are dead already.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.35,1:07:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用政治来搪塞我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't embroil me in politics now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.64,1:07:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,首相下令进行听证 你到时必须参加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister's ordered an inquiry. You'll have to appear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.81,1:07:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白天站在人群当中？看看现在谁好糊弄了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, standing in the stocks at midday? Who's antiquated now?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.27,1:07:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你自己听听自己在说什么 我们是民主社会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake, listen to yourself. We're a democracy,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.48,1:07:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要对我们保护的人负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}accountable to the people we're trying to defend.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.20,1:08:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法暗箱操作了 事情已经败露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep working in the shadows. There are no more shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.70,1:08:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没开窍 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.70,1:08:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管幕后主脑是谁 不管这一切是谁做的 他对我们了如指掌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever's behind this, whoever's doing it, he knows us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.00,1:08:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的一员 他和邦德同出一处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of us. He comes from the same place as Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.63,1:08:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来自你说不存在的那个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place you say doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.50,1:08:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴暗的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.33,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在为时不晚 我们现在还能掉头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too late. We could turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.72,1:09:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一夜间就废弃了这小岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They abandoned it almost overnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.93,1:09:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让他们以为这座岛上有化学试剂泄漏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made them think there was a leak at the chemical plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.93,1:09:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会惊讶 小小的一台电脑就能引起这么大的恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing the panic you can cause with a single computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.44,1:09:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要这座岛 就伸手拿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted the island, so he took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总能要什么 就得到什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he always get what he wants?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.90,1:10:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,超乎你的想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.78,1:10:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.65,1:10:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 詹姆斯 欢迎欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, James. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.98,1:10:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这岛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like the island?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.86,1:10:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我外婆就有座小岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother had an island.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.99,1:10:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好炫耀的 那个岛一个小时就能走遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to boast of. You could walk around it in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.54,1:10:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那地方对我们来说 还是和天堂一般{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still, it was, it was a paradise for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.21,1:10:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,某个夏天 我们去看外婆的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One summer, we went for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.67,1:11:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现那地方已经被老鼠占据了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and discovered the place had been infested with rats!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.01,1:11:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们乘着钓鱼的船到了岛上 靠吃椰子为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd come on a fishing boat and gorged themselves on coconut.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.51,1:11:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么把老鼠赶出小岛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do you get rats off an island? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.85,1:11:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我外婆演示给我看的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother showed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.64,1:11:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们埋了一个油桶 上面系着木桶盖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We buried an oil drum and hinged the lid,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.52,1:11:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把椰子系在木桶盖上做诱饵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then wired coconut to the lid as bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.98,1:11:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠来吃那个椰子 接着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rats would come for the coconut and…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.69,1:11:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就自然而然掉进了木桶里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would fall into the drum.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,过一个月 就能逮到所有的老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after a month, you have trapped all the rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.70,1:11:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接下来怎么处理那木桶呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do you do then?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.49,1:11:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把木桶扔到海里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw the drum into the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.25,1:11:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧了木桶？不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.71,1:11:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把木桶放在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.75,1:11:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后老鼠会越来越饿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they begin to get hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.92,1:11:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个接一个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one by one…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.01,1:11:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们开始撕咬对方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they start eating each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.93,1:11:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到剩下最后两个 就两只幸存了下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until there are only two left. The two survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后怎样？杀了它们？不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what? Do you kill them? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.73,1:12:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要放它们回归树林就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take them and release them into the trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.40,1:12:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那时候 它们不再吃椰子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now they don't eat coconut anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.44,1:12:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只吃老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they only eat rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.40,1:12:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了它们的天性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have changed their nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.78,1:12:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个幸存者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two survivors,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.03,1:12:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是这么造就我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what she made us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.41,1:12:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了自己的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made my own choices.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.75,1:12:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是自己选的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.04,1:12:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是她天才的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's her genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.80,1:12:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,H站 我说对了吗？在香港{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station H. Am I right? Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.64,1:12:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.10,1:12:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,从86年待到97年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'86 to '97.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.97,1:12:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候 我是她的首选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back then, I was her favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.39,1:12:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 你跟我简直没法比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not nearly the agent I was, I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.56,1:12:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你自己 靠着药片酒精才勉强活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at you, barely held together by your pills and your drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.15,1:12:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我对国家那点可怜的热爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget my pathetic love of country.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.28,1:12:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是对那老女人有着信仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still clinging to your faith in that old woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.08,1:12:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她所做的只是欺骗你而已 - 她从来没骗过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When all she does is lie to you. - She never lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.54,1:13:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从来没有？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.58,1:13:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你枪法测试最后成绩如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you score in your marksmanship evaluation?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.83,1:13:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,70分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}70.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.50,1:13:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实只有40分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}40.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.80,1:13:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟你说 心理医师准许你复职上任吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she tell you the psychologist cleared you for duty?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.34,1:13:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 大错特错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.19,1:13:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,药物检测 不合格 体能测试 不合格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical evaluation, fail. Physical evaluation, failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.94,1:13:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理检测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychological evaluation,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.23,1:13:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「依赖酒精和成瘾物」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Alcohol and substance addiction indicated."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.16,1:13:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「由于未痊愈的童年心理创伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Pathological rejection of authority.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.74,1:13:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对权威有病态的排斥心理「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}based on unresolved childhood trauma."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.00,1:13:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「测试对象不允许执行任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Subject is not approved for field duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.63,1:13:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并建议立即停职相关工作「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and immediate suspension from service advised."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.01,1:13:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这不是背叛 那又是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this if not betrayal?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.18,1:13:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知你还没准备好 有可能会牺牲 但她还是派你来调查我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She sent you after me knowing you're not ready, knowing you'll likely die.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.35,1:14:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪做人不厚道！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy was very bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.39,1:14:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.41,1:14:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.71,1:14:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她都对你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what she's done to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.04,1:14:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她至少没把我绑在椅子上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she never tied me to a chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.05,1:14:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她的损失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.38,1:14:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这是和M有关系吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is about M?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.72,1:14:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和她有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.10,1:14:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你和我更有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.43,1:14:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是剩下的那两只老鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, we are the last two rats.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以自相残杀…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can either eat each other…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.86,1:14:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.40,1:14:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者对其他人下手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or eat everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.08,1:15:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在拼命回忆以前做过的训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you're trying to remember your training now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.08,1:15:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种情形该如何解决？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the regulation to cover this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.25,1:15:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有第一次的 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first time for everything. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.47,1:15:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你会觉得我是第一次呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think this is my first time?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.60,1:15:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 邦德先生！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.10,1:15:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些体能训练… 愚蠢 太愚蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that physical stuff… so dull, so dull.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.94,1:15:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,追捕间谍…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing spies…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.48,1:15:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老掉牙了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so old-fashioned!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.78,1:15:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的膝盖肯定疼死了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your knees must be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.41,1:15:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}England.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.29,1:15:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,女王！军情六处！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Empire! MI6!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是活着废墟里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're living in a ruin as well,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.38,1:15:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是不知道而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just don't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.34,1:16:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在这里 没有老女人冲你发号施令 也没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least here there are no old ladies giving orders and no little…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.89,1:16:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔哔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bip!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.97,1:16:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没那么多Q组的小玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadgets from those fools in Q-Branch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.52,1:16:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你想的话 你可以自己选择机密任务 就像我一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanted, you could pick your own secret missions. As I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.53,1:16:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开口说就行 直接说就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name it. Name it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.70,1:16:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过控制股票来动摇一个国际大集团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destabilize a multinational by manipulating stocks…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.74,1:16:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔哔 就这么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bip. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.04,1:16:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,中断喀布尔间谍卫星的通信…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interrupt transmissions from a spy satellite over Kabul…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.46,1:16:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.00,1:16:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵乌干达的选举 让出价最高者获胜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rig an election in Uganda. All to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.67,1:16:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是在伦敦引起瓦斯爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a gas explosion in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.05,1:16:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,选个地方 点确定就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just point and click.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.89,1:16:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能说 萝卜青菜各有所爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, everybody needs a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.48,1:16:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你想要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.98,1:16:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新崛起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.36,1:17:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.71,1:17:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,景致不错 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tells a story, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.88,1:17:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑得太匆忙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left the island so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.80,1:17:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及考虑需要带什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they couldn't decide what to take,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.84,1:17:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要舍弃什么 什么才是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what to leave, what was important.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.05,1:17:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片废墟无时无刻地提醒我 做事要抓重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And seeing this every day reminds me to focus on the essentials.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.23,1:17:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来… 从来不做无关紧要的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing… nothing superfluous in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.19,1:17:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来多余的东西 都要被消灭掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a thing is redundant, it is eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.04,1:17:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,50年陈酿麦卡伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}50-year-old Macallan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.62,1:17:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是你的最爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A particular favorite of yours, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.42,1:17:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 为什么而干杯呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the toast?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.88,1:18:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为了我们心爱的女人」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the women we love?"
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.60,1:18:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.81,1:18:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你的情人都在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling, your lovers are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.11,1:18:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.16,1:18:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站直了 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up straight. Keep still.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.79,1:18:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管做什么 头别晃哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever you do, don't lose your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持住…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.96,1:18:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,头别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.67,1:18:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,头别乱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.67,1:18:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候重新测验你的枪技了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to redeem your marksmanship scores.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.13,1:18:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拭目以待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.18,1:18:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谁先打碎她头上的杯子呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can be the first to knock the glass from her head?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.52,1:19:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了体现公平 我让你先来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just to be sporting, I'll let you go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.50,1:19:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们谁先死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who ends up on top.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.85,1:19:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.02,1:19:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不相信！你那天难道真的死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it! Did you really die that day?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.48,1:19:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道007已经沦落到不敢开枪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any, any of the old 007 left?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.87,1:19:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.87,1:20:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win. What do you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.55,1:20:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多好的威士忌 都浪费了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a waste of good Scotch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.89,1:20:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你要做什么？把我带回去？就凭你一个人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do now? Take me back to her? All on your own?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.10,1:20:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我是一个人的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I'm on my own?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.88,1:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q组的最新设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the latest thing from Q-Branch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.75,1:20:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电通信设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.61,1:21:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 该打声招呼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, time to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.69,1:21:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我印象中瘦多了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smaller than I remember!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.02,1:21:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我完全不记得你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas I barely remember you at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.40,1:21:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可怪了 对我来说 就像昨日重现一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange. For me, it feels just like yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.53,1:21:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是很惊讶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.16,1:21:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒不是 但你总是特工中最狡猾的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not particularly. But then you always were a slippery one.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.74,1:22:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是为什么你那么喜欢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why you liked me so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.25,1:22:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别自吹自擂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.83,1:22:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都没后悔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No remorse.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.71,1:22:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我所预料的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I had imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.67,1:22:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,悔恨是不专业的表现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regret is unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.18,1:22:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「悔恨是不专业的表现」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Regret is unprofessional."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.60,1:22:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把我关在不见天日的囚室里 折磨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kept me for five months in a room with no air. They tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.27,1:22:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直没有招供你的机密 我保护了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I protected your secrets. I protected you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.19,1:22:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们一直折磨我 折磨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they made me suffer. And suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.07,1:22:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.95,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我意识到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I realized…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.08,1:22:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was you who betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.63,1:22:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我只剩一个选择了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I had only one thing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.76,1:22:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我左边臼齿下藏的那颗毒药胶囊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cyanide capsule in my back left molar.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.38,1:22:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.47,1:23:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我咬断牙齿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I broke the tooth and…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.60,1:23:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃下了那颗胶囊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bit into the capsule.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.31,1:23:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.98,1:23:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就感觉全身都在燃烧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it burned all my insides.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.24,1:23:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.16,1:23:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命就像狗皮膏药 粘着不走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life clung to me like a disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.42,1:23:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.79,1:23:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到我为什么活下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understood why I had survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再最后和你对视一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to look in your eyes one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.31,1:23:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望对你来说是值得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope it was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.43,1:23:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,西法先生 你将被送去贝尔马什监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Silva, you're going to be transferred to Belmarsh Prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.31,1:23:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将在那被关押直到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you'll be remanded in custody.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.86,1:23:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇家检察院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the Crown Prosecution Service.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.73,1:23:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为你可以受审…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}deem you fit to stand trial for…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.61,1:23:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我的名字 说啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say my name. Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.20,1:24:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的真名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My real name.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.87,1:24:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你记得的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you remember it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.95,1:24:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是刻在你所袭击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name is on the memorial wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.08,1:24:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部纪念墙上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the very building you attacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.96,1:24:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将把你的名字剔除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have it struck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.21,1:24:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你就会失去你的过去和未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon your past will be as nonexistent as your future.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.38,1:24:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会再见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.30,1:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那东西把我害成什么样了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what it does to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.64,1:24:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个氰化氢胶囊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydrogen cyanide?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.32,1:24:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你的成果吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look upon your work.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.87,1:24:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦破解他电脑里的信息就通知我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know what you recover from his computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.91,1:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有把名单给其他人？如果有 给谁了？赶快解决这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he transmitted the lists? If so, to whom? I want this resolved.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.46,1:25:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.96,1:25:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫迪亚果·罗德里格斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Tiago Rodriguez.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.05,1:25:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是个很出色的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a brilliant agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.55,1:25:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他曾经越职违规 黑入中国的电脑系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he started operating beyond his brief, hacking the Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.39,1:25:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们提出移交 目标是那个特工 所以我放弃他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The handover was coming up and they were onto him, so I gave him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.60,1:25:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们换回了六个特工安全回归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got six agents in return and a peaceful transition.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.10,1:25:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了 夫人 听证会将在30分钟后开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go, ma'am. Board of Inquiry begins in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.40,1:26:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道那电脑里的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what's on that computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.29,1:26:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,面前的这台就是西法的电脑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, looking at Silva's computer,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.29,1:26:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 他也还是有点才华的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems to me he's done a number of slightly unusual things.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.30,1:26:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他设计了一个安全破坏机制{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's established failsafe protocols to wipe the memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.42,1:26:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要查看某些文件 电脑将自动删除所有内存{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's any attempt to access certain files.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.80,1:26:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上会这种编程的屈指可数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only six people in the world could program safeguards like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.64,1:26:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会那么简单 你能破解吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course there are. Can you get past them?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.48,1:26:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种编程是我发明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I invented them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.31,1:26:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看你准备了什么大礼 西法先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you've got for us, Mr. Silva.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.36,1:26:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.20,1:26:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这个如何处理？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是电脑的核心程式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his Omega site.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.63,1:27:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最难破译的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most encrypted level he has.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.22,1:27:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去使用极其复杂的代码来隐藏其核心程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like obfuscated code to conceal its true purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.31,1:27:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种复杂化的加密手段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security through obscurity.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.31,1:27:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 女士们 请保持肃静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, if I might have order?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.02,1:27:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在会议开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to begin the proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.82,1:27:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天聚首 是为了强调一个很严重的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gathered today to address important issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.61,1:27:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,关系到国土未来安全的一个重大问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}concerning the future of our national security.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.20,1:27:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是要去远足吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.25,1:27:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你认为自己在这段危机时刻对于军情六处的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you believe your stewardship of Ml6 during the recent crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.67,1:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,管理是完全称职的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been up to scratch?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.38,1:27:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们已经抓获主要嫌犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I believe we have apprehended the responsible party.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.59,1:27:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且采取了一切必要措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are taking all necessary steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.47,1:27:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来保证机密信息不至于外泄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure that the sensitive information is contained.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.68,1:27:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说 你们做得很好咯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.43,1:27:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不否认之前的一些错误 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it's gone perfectly, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.31,1:28:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想你会原谅我没给你发国旗奖励你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll forgive me for not putting up the bunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.44,1:28:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会忽视那次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it rather difficult to overlook monumental.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.44,1:28:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统入侵 从而导致特工丧生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}security breaches and dead operatives.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.48,1:28:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这一切都是因为你一个人的失职 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which you are almost single-handedly responsible.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.16,1:28:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用了一个多态引擎来随时改变代码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using a polymorphic engine to mutate the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我想要入侵 代码便发生改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever I try to gain access, it changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.70,1:28:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像玩一个会反抗的魔方一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like solving a Rubik's cube that's fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.34,1:28:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.09,1:28:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那里试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go in on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.18,1:28:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白金汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granborough.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.89,1:28:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,白金汉路 是一个都市线的老地铁站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granborough Road. It's an old Tube station on the Metropolitan Line.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.81,1:28:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年没用过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been closed for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.48,1:28:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个当做密钥试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use that as a key.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.00,1:29:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了 是个地图！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look, it's a map!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.33,1:29:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's London.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.50,1:29:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦的地下通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subterranean London.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.38,1:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事情了？门怎么都打开了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Why are the doors open?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.10,1:29:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.14,1:29:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能告诉我 他是怎么入侵到我们系统的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can someone tell me how the hell he got into our system?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.61,1:29:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.15,1:29:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.95,1:29:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他黑了我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hacked us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.75,1:29:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.30,1:29:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 Q{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.14,1:29:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.94,1:30:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在隔离区下面的楼梯井{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a stairwell below isolation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.23,1:30:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到吗 Q？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me, Q?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.78,1:30:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了 我正在找你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear you. I'm looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.29,1:30:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 正在地图上定位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you. Tracking your location.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.33,1:30:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,照直往前走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.25,1:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入下一个安全门 在你右边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enter the next service door on your right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.22,1:30:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你过了门 你应该就到地铁隧道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're through that door, you should be in the Tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.01,1:30:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在隧道里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the Tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.10,1:30:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德 这不是一次简单的逃脱 是经过多年精心策划的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond, this isn't an escape. This was years in the planning.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.27,1:30:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他故意让我们抓到他 故意让我们解析他的电脑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted us to capture him, he wanted us to access his computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.94,1:30:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是计划好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.65,1:30:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部的爆炸 我们的紧急措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blowing up HQ. Knowing the emergency protocols.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.32,1:30:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们会撤离到这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing we'd retreat down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.44,1:30:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我都知道了 我担心的是他的下一步计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got all that. It's what he's got planned next that worries me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.03,1:31:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁站是最近的出口 你的左边有一个安全门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}District Line is the closest. There's a service door on your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.62,1:31:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.54,1:31:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't open.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.88,1:31:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的 使劲推就会开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will. Put your back into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.21,1:31:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不下来自己试试呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come down here and put your back into it?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.38,1:31:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 被堵住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.01,1:31:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 有辆地铁过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. There's a train coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.39,1:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊心动魄啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. That's vexing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.33,1:31:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm through.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.37,1:31:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,早说了能开的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.00,1:31:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想已经触发地铁警报了 警察会赶过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We alerted security. Police are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.49,1:32:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.91,1:32:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天普地铁站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temple Tube station.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.46,1:32:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还赶上了伦敦的上班潮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with half of London.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.75,1:32:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你了 在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see you. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.67,1:32:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我在哪儿 Q 他呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where I am, Q. Where's he?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.63,1:32:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下 我在找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a second. I'm looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.55,1:32:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意站台间缝隙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.94,1:32:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,人太多了 我找不到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many people. I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.06,1:32:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎在上班高峰乘坐地铁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to rush hour on the Tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.69,1:32:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计你没体会过人流高峰期的地铁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not something you'd know much about.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.82,1:32:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意站台间缝隙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.20,1:33:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,车就要走了 我乘这趟车子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train's leaving. Do I get on the train?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.54,1:33:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别上车 我还不确定他上去了 等我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get on. I'm not sure he's on it. Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.00,1:33:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底上不上车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I get on the train?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.01,1:33:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.14,1:33:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Get on the train.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.36,1:33:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想回家想疯了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's keen to get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.61,1:33:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否开下门？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you open the door, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.62,1:33:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.66,1:33:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫生安全部门的 你继续工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health and Safety. Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.55,1:34:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.80,1:34:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜呢 Q{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a wild guess, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.18,1:34:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他换装了 伪装成警察了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in disguise, dressed as a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.72,1:34:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.29,1:34:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going? Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.42,1:34:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝M那边去了 告诉坦纳 让她赶紧离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going for M. Tell Tanner. Get her out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.63,1:34:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忽视了 或是说故意无视那些铁证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've overlooked, or chosen to ignore, hard evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.97,1:34:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且一贯地 固执地…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and consistently, almost obstinately…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.18,1:34:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,西法逃走了 邦德正在追捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silva's escaped. Bond's in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.81,1:34:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得立刻让你到安全的地方避难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you to a secure location immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.48,1:34:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我现在转身走人 会被她骂死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned if I'm gonna show her my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.06,1:35:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让你走神了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we straining your attention?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.40,1:35:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 首相 请您继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please, Minister, proceed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.79,1:35:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.60,1:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！走开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.20,1:36:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你一直幻想着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as if you insist on pretending.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.33,1:36:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还处于谍战时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still live in a golden age of espionage.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.71,1:36:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么情报部门的信息才是最可靠的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where human intelligence was the only resource available.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.84,1:36:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这种老套的观念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I find this rather old-fashioned belief.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.26,1:36:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,体现出你根本无视…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}demonstrates a reckless disregard for…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.72,1:36:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 首相 我不是有意打断你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Minister, I don't mean to interrupt,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.05,1:36:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是为了听证的合理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just for the sake of variety,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.55,1:36:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是否应该传唤目击者呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}might we actually hear from the witness?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.64,1:36:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.23,1:37:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.01,1:37:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一击我可不会射偏了 西法先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't miss next time, Mr. Silva.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.22,1:37:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 詹姆斯 受了伤准头还那么高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad. Not bad, James, for a physical wreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.10,1:37:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.43,1:37:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逮到我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caught me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.52,1:37:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为给你的奖励{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, here's your prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.69,1:37:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩具店里的最新产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The latest thing from my local toy store.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.57,1:37:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做无线电通信设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.74,1:37:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真精彩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.29,1:38:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这个不是为我准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do hope that wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.71,1:38:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.46,1:38:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是为你准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.18,1:39:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席 各位秘书长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chairman. Ministers.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.85,1:39:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我多次听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today I've repeatedly heard how.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.27,1:39:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的部门是多么的不值一提{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}irrelevant my department has become.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.77,1:39:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们还需要特工？为什么我们还需要这个组织？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we need agents? The Double-O section?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.85,1:39:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切是不是已经过时了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it all rather quaint?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.69,1:39:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我看到的与你们看到的是不同的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose I see a different world than you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.03,1:39:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所见到的东西深深震撼了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the truth is that what I see frightens me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.16,1:39:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的恐惧是因为我们的敌人不再是我们熟知的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm frightened because our enemies are no longer known to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.62,1:39:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们躲在黑暗里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not exist on a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.50,1:39:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是任何的国家 而是个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not nations. They are individuals.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.25,1:39:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围 你怕的是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you. Who do you fear?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.01,1:39:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到一张面孔？一件制服？一面旗帜？你什么都看不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see a face? A uniform? A flag? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.05,1:39:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界如今越来越复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our world is not more transparent now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.39,1:39:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越难以捉摸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more opaque.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.31,1:39:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都躲在影子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.23,1:39:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们必须战斗的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we must do battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.36,1:39:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 在决定解散我们之前 请你扪心自问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, before you declare us irrelevant, ask yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.73,1:39:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否觉得安全？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How safe do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.57,1:40:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一件事想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just one more thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.91,1:40:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上一任丈夫非常热爱诗歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My late husband was a great lover of poetry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.83,1:40:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, um…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.83,1:40:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然并非我本意 但还是受到了些许熏陶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose some of it sunk in, despite my best intentions.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.42,1:40:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的一切又让我想起了这首丁尼生的诗：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here today I remember this, I think from Tennyson.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.22,1:40:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我们已力衰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not now that strength,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.68,1:40:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,全无往昔风采{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which in old days moved earth and heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.85,1:40:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们仍然是自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That which we are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.90,1:40:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有英雄的情怀与雄心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One equal temper of heroic hearts,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.57,1:40:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽因时间和命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}made weak by time.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.69,1:40:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,日益衰减{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fate,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.95,1:40:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但意志依然坚定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but strong in will.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.45,1:40:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去奋斗 去追求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To strive, to seek,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.08,1:40:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找寻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.87,1:40:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不屈服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not to yield.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.95,1:42:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.37,1:42:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.83,1:42:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别磨蹭！走！快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.83,1:42:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你在干什么？你是要绑架我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007, what the hell are we doing? Are you kidnapping me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.09,1:43:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来的确是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be one way of looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.84,1:43:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多人因为我而死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many people are dying because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.26,1:43:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想要你的命 他肯定会来找你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants you, he'll have to come and get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.55,1:43:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从开始就比西法慢一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been one step behind Silva from the start.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.06,1:43:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候逆转乾坤 领先一步了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to get out in front, change the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.18,1:43:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就是那个诱饵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm to be the bait?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.35,1:43:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是只有我们 没有别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. But just us. No one else.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.11,1:43:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Q？我需要帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Q? I need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.70,1:43:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟踪你们的车 你们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tracking the car. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.74,1:43:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和M在一起 我们现在要消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got M. We're about to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.16,1:43:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.45,1:43:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你把我们的痕迹统统清除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to lay a trail of breadcrumbs impossible to follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.70,1:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要留下只有西法能跟踪到的 我想你做得到对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for anyone except Silva. Think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.92,1:43:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这事不会被批准的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing this isn't strictly official.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.96,1:43:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even remotely.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.42,1:43:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这会毁了我的大好仕途{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for my promising career in espionage.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.10,1:43:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的好主意就是躲在这儿 我可不乐意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hiding in there, if that's your brilliant plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.64,1:43:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要换辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're changing vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.19,1:44:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用军情六处的车 因为车上有跟踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble with company cars is they have trackers.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.24,1:44:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这车真是太掩人耳目了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I suppose that's completely inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.99,1:44:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.98,1:44:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,车没那么舒服吧 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not very comfortable, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.86,1:44:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想一路抱怨过去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna complain the whole way?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.98,1:44:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把我弹射出去啊 我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, go on then, eject me. See if I care.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.28,1:44:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.24,1:44:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一切开始的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.62,1:44:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去一个对我们有利的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere we'll have the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.71,1:45:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是很难掌握{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fine line.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.29,1:45:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,留的线索太少了怕他找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the breadcrumb too small and he might miss it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.04,1:45:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,留的太多了又怕西法起疑心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too big and Silva will smell a rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.55,1:45:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你觉得西法会注意到你留的线索吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you think even Silva will be able to spot that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.63,1:45:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是唯一能懂的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one who could.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.89,1:45:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.56,1:45:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.06,1:45:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.43,1:45:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在… 监控{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just… monitoring.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.85,1:45:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造一个假信号让西法跟踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creating a false tracking signal for Silva to follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.40,1:45:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个 长官… - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, sir, um… - Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.52,1:45:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法很好 把他孤立开来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent thinking. Get him isolated.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.57,1:45:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他上A9公路 这条路没有岔口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him on the A9. It's the direct route.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.57,1:45:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以更准确地监视到他的动向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can monitor his progress more accurately.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.86,1:45:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能用公路探头监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and confirm it with the traffic cameras.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.91,1:45:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被首相发现了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if the PM finds out?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.24,1:45:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们都玩完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're all buggered.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.58,1:45:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.21,1:46:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是你长大的地方吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this where you grew up?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.71,1:46:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.30,1:46:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母在你多大的时候去世的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old were you when they died?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.89,1:46:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道答案的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.31,1:46:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,整件事你都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.27,1:46:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,孤儿是最好的新兵人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orphans always make the best recruits.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.08,1:47:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雨要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.68,1:48:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.93,1:48:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.47,1:48:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你从来不回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you never came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.28,1:49:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.91,1:49:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·邦德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.95,1:49:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.70,1:49:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.79,1:49:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴再见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.92,1:49:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 这一位是金凯德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M, this is Kincade.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.80,1:49:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我小时候就在这里看家护院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamekeeper here since I was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.13,1:49:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 艾玛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleased to meet you, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.34,1:49:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 金凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Kincade.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.43,1:49:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来晚了 他们已经把这里卖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a tad late. They've sold the place,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.30,1:49:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.64,1:49:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他们错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems they were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.60,1:49:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.31,1:49:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在追杀我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some men are coming to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.65,1:49:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会先杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're gonna kill them first.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.82,1:49:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好早作准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'd better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.61,1:49:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武器库还在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we still have a gun room?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.99,1:49:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.95,1:49:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把很多抢都卖给了从什么爱达荷州来的收藏家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sold the lot to a collector from Idaho or some such place.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.79,1:49:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期之前都被运走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were shipped out weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.46,1:49:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.50,1:50:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸留下的老猎枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your father's old hunting rifle.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.13,1:50:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不忍心卖掉这把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't let that go.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.93,1:50:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有这些了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is what we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.02,1:50:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像还有些从采石场弄来的雷管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a couple of sticks of dynamite from the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.35,1:50:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些都没用的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if all else fails,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.11,1:50:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候老办法才是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes the old ways are the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.37,1:50:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要对付的是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who is it we're supposed to be fighting?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.20,1:50:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「我们」 金凯德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No "we" in it, Kincade.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.04,1:50:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该被卷进来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.71,1:50:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想阻止我 你这臭小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and stop me, you jumped-up little shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.50,1:50:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 记住我教你的 别往左偏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, remember what I taught you. Don't let it pull to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.38,1:50:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.98,1:50:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是干什么工作的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say you did for a living?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.66,1:51:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾玛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emma!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.75,1:51:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了点好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you some things.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.59,1:51:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里晚上很冷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nights get cold here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.21,1:51:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 金凯德先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Kincade.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.59,1:51:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是间漂亮的老房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful old house.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.76,1:51:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的确很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.76,1:51:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像所有女士一样 她也有自己的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like all great ladies, she still has her secret ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.18,1:51:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我带你参观一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.61,1:51:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个祭祀洞？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priest's hole?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.03,1:51:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 工业革命的时候留下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, from Reformation times.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.94,1:51:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道一直通向外面的沼泽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tunnel leads under the moor.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.24,1:51:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遇到危险 这里是最好的藏身之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get in danger, this is the place to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.08,1:51:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚我告诉他双亲去世了 他在里面躲了两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night I told him his parents had died, he hid in here for two days.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.79,1:51:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他出来的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he did come out…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.63,1:52:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不再是小孩子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wasn't a boy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.84,1:52:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得开工了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh. Must get on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.50,1:54:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我搞砸的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucked this up, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.13,1:54:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.22,1:54:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是做了你应该做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.06,1:54:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读了你给我写的悼词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read your obituary of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.48,1:54:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.77,1:54:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appalling.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.73,1:54:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我知道你不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I knew you'd hate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.36,1:54:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得说了 你是「你是英国精神的榜样」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did call you "an exemplar of British fortitude".
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.74,1:54:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一点倒是没说错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bit was all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.62,1:54:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.33,1:54:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你出生之前我就准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready before you were born, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.70,1:56:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到苏格兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.07,1:57:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掉东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dropped something.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.64,1:57:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.56,1:57:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我的骄傲被击碎了 我从来开枪就没准头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only my pride. I never was a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.90,1:58:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.40,1:58:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的出场方式总是这么夸张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always got to make an entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.82,1:58:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个去厨房 现在就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, go to the kitchen. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.05,1:59:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到拱门的后面去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind the arch!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.51,1:59:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,去祭祀洞 走隧道出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the chapel. Use the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.97,2:01:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人听着！谁都不许碰她 她是我的猎物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, listen to me! Don't you dare touch her. She's mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.20,2:01:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友能出来打声招呼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can your friend come out and say hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.52,2:02:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.46,2:03:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直很讨厌这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always hated this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.89,2:04:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你暖和点了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you getting warm?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.31,2:05:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看邦德是不是炸死了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make sure Bond's dead!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.86,2:05:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就剩我和她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's me and her.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.18,2:07:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这些闹剧有什么意义吗 邦德先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what comes of all this running around, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.81,2:07:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直这样战斗下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this jumping and fighting.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.23,2:07:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很累人的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exhausting!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.28,2:07:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.41,2:07:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to relax.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.97,2:08:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧… 妈妈在叫我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well… mother's calling.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.39,2:08:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给她一个告别之吻的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give her a goodbye kiss for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.91,2:08:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.62,2:10:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.91,2:10:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be here.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.91,2:10:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.00,2:10:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.59,2:10:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能找到别的… - 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't find it no… - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.26,2:10:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.15,2:11:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了 你受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurt. You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.82,2:11:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都对你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have they done to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.90,2:11:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,解放我们两个吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free both of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.90,2:11:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,用同一颗子弹…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free both of us…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.95,2:12:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从此就都自由了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the same bullet.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.95,2:12:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.96,2:12:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.96,2:12:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:27.02,2:12:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.21,2:12:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一只老鼠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last rat standing.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.27,2:13:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,007 你怎么那么久才来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}007. What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.56,2:13:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去水里游了个泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got into some deep water.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.44,2:13:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.54,2:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it's…
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.04,2:13:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我可能逃不掉了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}too late to make a run for it?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.55,2:13:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就当你是在开玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm game if you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.89,2:13:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我至少做对了一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did get one thing right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:18.52,2:15:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.03,2:15:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你还能爬到屋顶来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even know you could come up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.53,2:15:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌浪费了那么好的风景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate to waste a view.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.74,2:15:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看出原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.24,2:15:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可以回去继续执行任务了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were going back out on active service.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.62,2:15:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I declined.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.08,2:15:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it yourself,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.04,2:15:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作不是所有人都能做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}fieldwork's not for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.76,2:15:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你听进去了 我就觉得安全多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it helps, I feel a lot safer.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.93,2:15:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天宣读了她的遗嘱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her will was read today.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.72,2:15:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把这个留给了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left you this.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.49,2:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她是在用自己的方式告诉你 应该找一份文职工作了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was her way of telling you to take a desk job.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.24,2:16:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许正好相反{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.21,2:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.43,2:16:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我们从来没有正式相互介绍过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we've never formally been introduced.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.65,2:16:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫伊芙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my name's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.90,2:16:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙·钱班尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.28,2:16:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能与你共事 伊芙·钱班尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I look forward to our time together, Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.36,2:16:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 我很肯定以后能多刮几次胡子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too. I'm sure we'll have one or two close shaves.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.91,2:16:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 007{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, 007.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.08,2:16:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 坦纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.54,2:17:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在可以见你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll see you now.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.97,2:17:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,手臂怎么样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the arm, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.98,2:17:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个？哦 好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.56,2:17:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:21.94,2:17:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于一个不出任务的人来说 中枪还真是恐怖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All pretty shocking for someone unused to fieldwork.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:27.82,2:17:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 007… 有很多工作要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, 007… lots to be done.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.49,2:17:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好回到工作岗位了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to get back to work?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.33,2:17:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳 M{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure, M.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.67,2:17:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With pleasure.
